<title>USA: Virginia HDA, $22.090 mln won by Craigie.</title>
<headline>Virginia HDA, $22.090 mln won by Craigie.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Craigie Inc. said it won $22.090 million of Virginia Housing Development Auth., multi-family housing taxable bonds, 1997 Series C, with a true interest cost of 7.285 percent.</p>
</text>
